> Verification and limits

The shared six native tests verify complete full/compact graphs,both actual
40class1024point forwards/all finite gradients,nine host penalty derivatives,
18independent shared-unit/BN/input derivatives,all compact source identities,
state modes and invalid inputs. Fourteen public API examples compile/run.
Independent original mesh sampling replay is exact. The original model-specific
three-epoch program also passes. A small custom unpretrained fit and twelve
held-out objects do not reproduce a published40class benchmark.
The selected epoch3 has validation NLL1.081701,held-out accuracy2/3,
macroF1.538721,NLL1.089158 and recalls1/0/1:all four sofas are missed.
Fixed fitting inference NLL worsens1.099125861->1.128235405. Independent
source/report replay matches all108selected learned/moving arrays
(174876scalars) and every held-out/initial logit exactly. Fitting
inference NLL can worsen despite lower batch-moment training objectives;
source moving-state behavior and complete held-out errors remain explicit.

> Conclusion

The complete tensor graph and independent implementation checks pass. The short custom fit and all original held-out errors must be assessed separately from graph correctness;no full ModelNet40 or pretrained recognition claim is implied.

> References

- [Qi et al.(2017),PointNet](https://arxiv.org/abs/1612.00593).
- [Qi et al.(2017),PointNet++](https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.02413).
- [Official ModelNet source data](https://modelnet.cs.princeton.edu/).
